FUNCTION HTTPGET(URL)
* mvx-lang/curl — HTTP GET via libcurl through CallC (CURLGET), returning the
* response body on a 2xx status ("" otherwise).  libcurl handles TLS, redirects
* and binary bodies.  Needs the CallC library (libu2callc.so) built with the
* curl contribution (udt-callc-build folds in curlcallcb.o).  GPL-2.0-only.
   PERFORM "UDT.OPTIONS 88 ON"        ;* enable CallC
   RETURN CALLC CURLGET(URL)
